@name     data_length
@alias    dlen
@group    data
@c_name   skode_clause_data_length
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  report data array length
@doc
Prints the data array length and returns it in @0. Use as an acknowledgement after piecewise uploads.
Usage: dlen
@code
    return skode_exec_d_len(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
